

-> What is Runtime Constant Pool?
    Per-class constant pool
    Created when class is loaded
    Stores:
        Literals
        Symbolic references
        Method & field references


| String Pool            | Constant Pool            |
| ---------------------- | ------------------------ |
| Stores String literals | Stores all constants     |
| Part of heap           | Part of method area      |
| Only Strings           | Numbers, methods, fields |


-> What is Symbolic Reference?
    Reference that does not point to memory directly

    Example: java/lang/String

